<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">MCQ:</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
Why is Australia notable in the context of microchipping citizens? A) It has the highest population density. B) It is the first country to begin microchipping its citizens. C) It has the largest number of microchip manufacturers. D) It has the most advanced technology in healthcare.</span></span>
